sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task + intent-as-workflow-inputs + single-swamp-node; orbit-instance-run-account; DECISIONS R4 (commands as inputs, sudo -u intent account, terminal projection).
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as app-dev Node<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: instance:setup<br/>{instance: 42}
  Note over GW: Check active dev Instance<br/>list digest · task #5131
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>step commands, account as inputs
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>operation #5131
  loop each admitted step
    SW->>N: Run the step in checkout<br/>@swamp/ssh · sudo -u intent user
    N-->>SW: exit 0
  end
  alt all steps pass
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal projection · outcome
    Note over GW: Clear failed_step<br/>task → succeeded
  else a step fails or times out
    N--xSW: exit ≠ 0 or timeout
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>failed_step, error_code
    Note over GW: Keep Instance, mark failed<br/>instance.setup_step_failed
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5131
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
